# Track structure and docs; data files are added intentionally by the data owner.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!.gitkeep
!manifest.json
!samples/
!samples/**
!scripts/
!scripts/**
!boundaries/
!boundaries/**
# ETL outputs (no personal data); raw/ stays ignored: API dumps include BO authors' names
!poi/
!poi/**
!lines/
!lines/**
# Travel times for the map; the full grid and other grid outputs stay ignored
!grid/
!grid/czasy_przejazdu.geojson
# Python bytecode (overrides the !scripts/** re-include above)
__pycache__/
